// ── ROOT RE-CHECKED: the closure's inferred signature ties `y`'s region to the return
//    region; `f(&z)` pins it to `z`'s, so `f(x)` returns a `&i64` carrying a local's
//    region out of `foo`. Nothing constrains a closure's region except a `dyn`
